|$ given that $\\,|\\begin{aligned}x & 1 & 10 \\\\ 2 & y & 0 \\\\ 5 & 0 & z\\end{aligned}|=8.$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that we have a block diagonal matrix. Therefore, its determinant is equal to the product of the diagonal blocks' determinants:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}x & 1 & 10 & 0 \\\\ 2 & y & 0 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 0 & z & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}| & =|\\begin{aligned}x & 1 & 10 & 0 \\\\ 2 & y & 0 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 0 & z & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}x & 1 & 10 \\\\ 2 & y & 0 \\\\ 5 & 0 & z\\end{aligned}|\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =8\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =24.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-109270/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4b507561-8134-50ff-8c23-c4ecc546450d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-109270"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-109271/selection/25b335c1798b7b6a4cb13a35c15bf802d740cecd154b47b5e805a756e83b1528" :answer/id #uuid "1aea0905-4d4b-576f-a9dc-d46a6a3c1f15" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-42" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109271/selection/f345fac9a81ccd096b9959c6e7a966a446e93e73b82d111a376f9064132509fd" :answer/id #uuid "16d1622e-eea5-5deb-8850-d012c848e27b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "24" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109271/selection/8bf9008bc778888b2d3f4240302b812727e0200209b4202da0461e41435934e6" :answer/id #uuid "1e35da17-772c-5470-a18f-ff07fae8ec69" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-72" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109271/selection/4fa830bda994f89067ddecaf273e4fa78aa4d8447b6388b70cafa0fc166e6f67" :answer/id #uuid "8b8c9222-476e-5562-8fea-1caddedc3112" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-50" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109271/selection/23a7b929cccc5bdeb88db3bdc770afbaf59570d63e930fc5c94f26cb6f5091dc" :answer/id #uuid "201e41b8-c958-58d4-9100-53464d277dfe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "60" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109271/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "7eecb776-cb5c-57a5-9f43-8be4a43a1e93" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-109271/selection/8bf9008bc778888b2d3f4240302b812727e0200209b4202da0461e41435934e6" :answer-field/choices ["q-109271/selection/25b335c1798b7b6a4cb13a35c15bf802d740cecd154b47b5e805a756e83b1528" "q-109271/selection/f345fac9a81ccd096b9959c6e7a966a446e93e73b82d111a376f9064132509fd" "q-109271/selection/8bf9008bc778888b2d3f4240302b812727e0200209b4202da0461e41435934e6" "q-109271/selection/4fa830bda994f89067ddecaf273e4fa78aa4d8447b6388b70cafa0fc166e6f67" "q-109271/selection/23a7b929cccc5bdeb88db3bdc770afbaf59570d63e930fc5c94f26cb6f5091dc"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-109271" :question/id #uuid "2c2a382e-f503-574b-a549-bf0e90a5f0ac" :question/math-academy-id "q-109271" :question/problem "Find $\\,|\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 3 & m & b & 0 \\\\ 5 & 0 & n & 0 \\\\ 8 & 0 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}|$ given that $\\,|\\begin{aligned}m & b \\\\ 0 & n\\end{aligned}|=-6.$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that we have a block lower triangular matrix. Therefore, its determinant is equal to the product of the diagonal blocks' determinants:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 3 & m & b & 0 \\\\ 5 & 0 & n & 0 \\\\ 8 & 0 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}| & =|\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 3 & m & b & 0 \\\\ 5 & 0 & n & 0 \\\\ 8 & 0 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =4\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}m & b \\\\ 0 & n\\end{aligned}|\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =4\\cdot (-6)\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =-72.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-109271/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4b507561-8134-50ff-8c23-c4ecc546450d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-109271"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-131460/selection/